# TinySAAI CODEOWNERS
#
# Three tiers, LAST MATCHING PATTERN WINS. The file runs broad → specific so the
# more restrictive tiers override the broader ones:
#
#   Tier 3 (work, broad default)        — the `*` line, then the reclaimed dirs
#   Tier 2 (infrastructure)             — *.md, .github/ scaffolding, Makefile
#   Tier 1 (governance, recovery, supply) — bottom of file
#
# Matching: a pattern with no slash (`*.md`) or only a trailing slash (`docs/`)
# matches at ANY depth; only a leading slash anchors to the repository root.
#
# Tier 1 here covers the code that writes flash and the path that flashes a
# unit: a mistake there can cost a unit its calibration or make it unflashable
# (Principle III). .gitmodules and the lib/ChibiOS pointer decide which
# upstream code, and which commit of it, the firmware is built from.
#
# Team rosters live in the GitHub org. A team must have access to this
# repository for its entries to take effect (see GOVERNANCE.md §Enforcement).
# No bot is a member of any team, so a bot-opened PR always needs a human
# approver.

# ── Tier 3: work, broad default ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*                                   @aethersdr/reviewers

# ── Tier 2: infrastructure ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Markdown outside the work directories reclaimed below: README, ROADMAP,
# CHANGELOG, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, GEMINI.md, copilot-instructions.
*.md                                @aethersdr/infrastructure
.github/                            @aethersdr/infrastructure
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES                @aethersdr/infrastructure
/Makefile                           @aethersdr/infrastructure

# ── Tier 3: work directories, markdown included ──────────────────────────────
# ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING: these must stay BELOW the *.md line, or their markdown
# silently falls back to Tier 2.
/src/                               @aethersdr/reviewers
/ai/                                @aethersdr/reviewers
/boards/                            @aethersdr/reviewers
/tools/                             @aethersdr/reviewers
/docs/                              @aethersdr/reviewers

# ── Tier 1: governance, recovery and supply chain — maintainer-only ──────────
CONSTITUTION.md                     @aethersdr/maintainers
.specify/memory/constitution.md     @aethersdr/maintainers
GOVERNANCE.md                       @aethersdr/maintainers
CONTRIBUTING.md                     @aethersdr/maintainers
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                  @aethersdr/maintainers
LICENSE                             @aethersdr/maintainers
SECURITY*                           @aethersdr/maintainers
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @aethersdr/maintainers
/.github/workflows/                 @aethersdr/maintainers
/src/flash.c                        @aethersdr/maintainers
/src/fw_update.*                    @aethersdr/maintainers
/boards/*.ld                        @aethersdr/maintainers
/ai/flash.py                        @aethersdr/maintainers
/.gitmodules                        @aethersdr/maintainers
/lib/ChibiOS                        @aethersdr/maintainers
